{"ref":"BDB, דּוּדַי","hw":"דּוּדַי","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דּוּדַי</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:14\" href=\"/Genesis.30.14\">Gn 30:14</a></sup> <strong>mandrake (</strong>as love-producing, cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:14\" href=\"/Genesis.30.14\">Gn 30:14</a><strong>)</strong>—pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוּדָאִים</span> cf. Ew<sup>189 g</sup> Sta<sup>§§ 301. 122</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:14\" href=\"/Genesis.30.14\">Gn 30:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:14\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.14\">Ct 7:14</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוּדָאֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:14\" href=\"/Genesis.30.14\">Gn 30:14</a> + 3 times;—<em>mandrakes</em>, as exciting sexual desire, and favouring procreation <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:14\" href=\"/Genesis.30.14\">Gn 30:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:15\" href=\"/Genesis.30.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:16\" href=\"/Genesis.30.16\">16</a> (J); also <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:14\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.14\">Ct 7:14</a> where odour referred to. On <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוּדָאֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.1\">Je 24:1</a> <em>vessels, baskets</em>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, דּוּד\" href=\"/BDB,_דּוּד\", dir=\"rtl\">דּוּד</a>.","next":"BDB, דּוּד","prev":"BDB, דָּוִד"}